When starting Reaper [with AudiofirePRE8] following notification:

"The following channes are in use by another application:
Analog Out 1
Analog Out 2
Audio output from these channels will be muted."

Fixes

1. disable 
> r.mouse speaker > Sounds > Playback > r.mouse <Device> > Properties
  > Advanced > uncheck 'Allow applications to take exclusive control of this device'

2. Apogee TalkBack helper is blocking
> ctrl + shift + Esc
  > Details
  > End process 'ApogeeTalkbackHelper.exe'
